{"schema":1,"revision":94440534,"page":{"pageid":5560841,"title":"營養午餐","displayTitle":"營養午餐","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%E4%B8%96%E7%B3%A7%E8%A8%88%E7%95%AB%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E8%98%86%E7%AB%B9%E5%9C%8B%E5%B0%8F.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/%E4%B8%96%E7%B3%A7%E8%A8%88%E7%95%AB%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E8%98%86%E7%AB%B9%E5%9C%8B%E5%B0%8F.jpg/250px-%E4%B8%96%E7%B3%A7%E8%A8%88%E7%95%AB%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E8%98%86%E7%AB%B9%E5%9C%8B%E5%B0%8F.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"252\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/%E4%B8%96%E7%B3%A7%E8%A8%88%E7%95%AB%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E8%98%86%E7%AB%B9%E5%9C%8B%E5%B0%8F.jpg/500px-%E4%B8%96%E7%B3%A7%E8%A8%88%E7%95%AB%E5%AD%B8%E7%AB%A5%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E8%98%86%E7%AB%B9%E5%9C%8B%E5%B0%8F.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1032\" /></a><figcaption>1970年，正在品嘗營養午餐的台灣小學生。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ky%C5%ABshoku@Japan_01.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Ky%C5%ABshoku%40Japan_01.jpg/250px-Ky%C5%ABshoku%40Japan_01.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"166\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Ky%C5%ABshoku%40Japan_01.jpg/500px-Ky%C5%ABshoku%40Japan_01.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4288\" data-file-height=\"2848\" /></a><figcaption>日本小學營養午餐</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>營養午餐</b>，是指在學校<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BE%9B%E9%A4%90\" title=\"供餐\">供應</a>的午餐，通常是<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%B8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"小學\">小學</a>到<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"高中\">高中</a>，因為這個階段都還在發育期，營養午餐十分重視學生的營養均衡，所以通常會有<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%AC%E8%8F%9C\" title=\"蔬菜\">蔬菜</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%82%89%E9%A1%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"肉類\">肉類</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AD%9A%E9%A1%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"魚類\">魚類</a>等<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。有些營養午餐會附上<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"水果\">水果</a>或點心<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。對於<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%81%8F%E9%84%89&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"偏鄉（頁面不存在）\">偏鄉</a>的學童而言，營養午餐可能是他們一天中的第一餐<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%87%9F%E9%A4%8A%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-b